### Add Venue
POST http://localhost:8080/api/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "The Grand Palace",
  "location": "Ghaziabad",
  "description": "A beautiful venue for weddings and events",
  "category": "Wedding Hall",
  "capacity": 500,
  "pricePerDay": 50000,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/venue.jpg",
  "available": true
}